  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1157858/description_09f850aa-c7b4-4f7c-a58b-6d063ce05acb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"521\" height=\"293\"></strong></h3>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:750px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HX6UJHA4eKg\" width=\"792\" height=\"458\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://ik.imagekit.io/yyjyznrctj/Screenshot 2025-11-23 155627.png\" width=\"1221\" height=\"572\"></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><code><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>歡迎來到 <em>Smoreh 的同化棲居者</em>！</strong></span></code><br>本模組為經典的洞穴棲居者引入了<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">有趣的</span>全新變體</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">曾經無害的棲居者如今已被<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em>同化</em></span>，它將開始追捕<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">你</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>壓倒一切&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;並&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;同化。</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">同化棲居者正悄然潛行，它的意識已不屬於自己，僅存寄生體在操控。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你聽見了它的聲音<br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">那就已經太遲了。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">絕對震撼 ✌️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">（注意：請勿安裝任何非官方移植版，以免含有病毒或造成損害，請注意安全。）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1157858/description_281ee7e5-8891-46e2-b925-bdcad4046745.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p>──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:1092px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4yq4_cvCtaw?t=88s\" width=\"794\" height=\"661\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:767px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wiN22N9NrKk\" width=\"767\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:762px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ktr_Fg9-i08\" width=\"762\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:768px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/czr7BQOLbaM?pp=ygUmYXNzaW1pbGF0ZWQgZHdlbGxlciBtb2QgdjMgYXNzaW1pbGF0b3I\" width=\"768\" height=\"452\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：我非常活躍於模組開發中，因此如果你的版本無法運作，請經常關注此模組更新！問題很快就會修復。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>希望你能喜歡這個模組 :D</p>",
